      "standard_id": "TRANS",
      "name": "Pathogen Transmission Ontology (TRANS)",
      "description": "An OBO Foundry ontology/vocabulary describing transmission methods of human disease pathogens (how pathogens move between hosts/reservoirs/sources). Available in OWL and OBO (trans.owl, trans.obo), uses OBO prefix TRANS and URIs under purl.obolibrary.org, CC0-licensed, contains ~32 terms with hierarchical (DAG) structure, definitions, synonyms and curator metadata — intended for annotating transmission processes."
    }
